  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">뻬훈<ruby style=\"position: relative\">팡<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sV9mi7CwWTI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">身軀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">迷魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻬훈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">芳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-tioh-lî-sīn-khû’e be-hun-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">跤步<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">카ˉ버ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">닿-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">錯<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">초</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">亂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">롼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khā-pōr tah-cho sīm-tháu loān\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">見<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">길`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一面<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">困難<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쿤`란ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bêh-kḭ̀-lì jit-bīn jiâh-khùn-lán\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’시 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄀᅷ`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띧ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">암</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    rît’si tân-kàu-rit-tháu am\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為何<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">위호-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">붇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">從<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">졍-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人願<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤꽌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-ho-thḭ̂ pût-jiong-rin-goān\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幸福<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱헉</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">悲傷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">비ˉ셩ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">黏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">럄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hieng-hork kâh-pī-siông siō-liám\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一場<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-tiōng-jiéng jit-tiṵ-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一場<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">空<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캉ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-tiōng-jiéng jit-tiṵ-khâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">得<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">딛-</rt></ruby>뾔둏’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">迷人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻬랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tit-boe-tioh’e ai siong-be-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一場<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-tiōng-jiéng jit-tiṵ-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一場<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">空<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캉ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-tiōng-jiéng jit-tiṵ-khâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流浪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">류렁ˉ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨嘆<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`탄</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-ai liu-lōng bo-oàn-than\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> 앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">只<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">痴<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">치ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ît-siêng ah jî-wi-lî-chî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">迷魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻬훈-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">芳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    be-hun-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n